    "description": "Map the P. falciparum erythrocyte invasion machinery by finding surface-exposed proteins (signal peptide or transmembrane) that are annotated as invasion/merozoite-related, then excluding var/RIFIN/STEVOR antigenic variation genes (which are surface proteins but not invasion ligands). Represents a key research area for vaccine and invasion-blocking antibody development.",
